      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my experience VMs might go on for days without being installed. In this case we\u0027ll run the failing import all the time very 15 minutes or so (I don\u0027t recall the frequency of the timer). Without keeping the state, is there anything we could check to prevent this to be run all the time? How quick is the check per host?",
